+    
+    
+    
+    ///////////////////////////////////
+    //                               //
+    //  Data bypass for low latency  //
+    //                               //
+    ///////////////////////////////////
+    
+    //data_out_clock_en is the clock enable for data_out when registered, otherwise it is clock enable for the read data register inside the M20K or MLAB itself
