+  end else begin : GEN_HYPER_PIPELINE_1 // HYPER_PIPELINE==1
+    /*********************************************************
+      High-FMAX design.
+    *********************************************************/
+    /* The following code is highly optimized and agressively pipelined, for higher FMAX.
